1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:04,278
瞧瞧你 打扮得像个女孩 为何改变
Look at you, dressed like a girl. Why the change?

2
00:00:04,278 --> 00:00:06,420
旱冰队又想招你去了吗
Did the roller-derby team try to recruit you again?

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:07,860
没有 我要跟本约会
No. I have a date with Ben.

4
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,740
感觉你看起来不是很乐意啊
You don't seem too excited about it.

5
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,360
他人是很好啦 而且...
Well, I mean, he's really nice, and --

6
00:00:12,360 --> 00:00:13,960
懂 你觉得无聊了 我也是
Got it. You're bored, and so am I.

7
00:00:14,340 --> 00:00:14,720
分手吧
Break up.

8
00:00:15,220 --> 00:00:17,340
我就想看看外边还有何种男人
I mean, I just want to see what else is out there.

9
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:19,060
-我这样有错吗 -天啊
- Does that make me a bad person? - Oh, my God.

10
00:00:19,100 --> 00:00:20,180
我们还在讨论这个事情吗
Are we still talking about this?

11
00:00:20,280 --> 00:00:21,760
我已经解决你的问题了 就今天
I solved your problem. Today.

12
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,840
找一家热闹的餐厅 免得他大吵大闹
Crowded restaurant so he doesn't make a scene.

13
00:00:24,080 --> 00:00:25,720
深呼吸 然后直接跟他说了
Just deep breath and say it.

14
00:00:26,620 --> 00:00:29,120
天大好消息 有人拿厕纸炸了我们家
Fantastic news! Someone TP'd our house!

15
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:30,540
万圣节狂欢正在逼近
Halloween fun is afoot.

16
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:33,020
老爸 我真心想为你感到兴奋
Dad, I really want to be excited for you,

17
00:00:33,100 --> 00:00:34,020
可这是万圣节
but Halloween?

18
00:00:34,640 --> 00:00:35,820
我们都已经老到可以投票了
We're almost old enough to vote.

19
00:00:38,580 --> 00:00:39,380
吓到我了
Got me!

20
00:00:39,880 --> 00:00:40,440
值得吗
Worth it?

21
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:42,620
怎么 你长大就不能让你害怕一下了吗
Oh, what, you're too old for a little scare?

22
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:44,740
最令人害怕的是你离当外婆可能只隔了
The scariest thing is you could be a cheap pick-up line,

23
00:00:44,780 --> 00:00:46,570
一次搭讪 两瓶啤酒和九个月时间
two beers, and nine months away from being a grandparent,

24
00:00:46,570 --> 00:00:48,358
而你却冒着窒息的风险躲在冰箱里
and you just risked asphyxiation in the fridge.

25
00:00:48,358 --> 00:00:50,615
我们又不是带你们去敲门要糖果
It's not like we're taking you trick-or-treating.

26
00:00:50,615 --> 00:00:53,054
成年人也有成年人过万圣节的方式啊
There are grown-up ways to enjoy Halloween.

27
00:00:53,054 --> 00:00:54,700
南瓜船比赛怎么样
How about pumpkin-boat racing?

28
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:56,080
小卡以前在密苏里州常做
Cam used to do it in Missouri.

29
00:00:56,080 --> 00:00:57,420
找一个巨大的南瓜
Take a giant pumpkin,

30
00:00:57,700 --> 00:00:58,640
去顶
cut the top off,

31
00:00:58,860 --> 00:01:00,740
去瓤 坐进 开划
gut it, hop in, sail away.

32
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:01,760
来吧
Let's do it.

33
00:01:01,760 --> 00:01:03,280
我爱死这个创意
I'm so married to this idea,

34
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,400
爱它到我跟人说笑话 它会像老婆一样翻白眼
it rolls its eyes when I make jokes in public.

35
00:01:06,460 --> 00:01:08,160
学着点 也许能对你甩掉本带来帮助
Take notes -- This might help you out with Ben later.

36
00:01:08,660 --> 00:01:09,920
老妈 老爸
Mom, Dad?

37
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:11,160
你们与万圣节
You and Halloween have had

38
00:01:11,160 --> 00:01:12,540
曾一起度过无数欢乐时光
some great times together.

39
00:01:12,940 --> 00:01:13,960
但如今物是人非
But it's over.

40
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:15,880
你们对过节来说太老了 令人不忍直视
You're way too old, and it's hard to look at.

41
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,680
跟你的事真的能串起来呢
Wow, it really lines up.

42
00:01:17,780 --> 00:01:18,980
我知道怎么回事了
I see what's going on here.

43
00:01:19,080 --> 00:01:19,740
谢天谢地
Thank God.

44
00:01:19,820 --> 00:01:21,060
我还没有说
I haven't communicated how big

45
00:01:21,060 --> 00:01:22,020
这南瓜会有多大
this pumpkin's gonna be.

46
00:01:22,480 --> 00:01:24,800
听过童书《超级红卜卜》那只两层楼高的狗吗
You guys know Clifford -- the Big Red Dog?

47
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:25,780
我们不想玩
We're not doing this.

48
00:01:25,900 --> 00:01:26,829
而且 我们都有约会了
Plus, we all have dates.

49
00:01:26,829 --> 00:01:28,601
-但是 -我觉得他们过那年纪了
- But-- -I think they're past it.

50
00:01:30,186 --> 00:01:31,315
有点太残酷了 对吧
That was kinda harsh, huh?

51
00:01:31,315 --> 00:01:32,880
亲爱的 你别太往心里去
Oh, honey, don't take it too personally.

52
00:01:32,880 --> 00:01:34,980
我吗 明显是针对你的啊 冰箱怪物
Me? That was directed at you, fridge monster.

53
00:01:34,980 --> 00:01:36,520
你才是痴迷过万圣节的人啊
You're the one who's obsessed with Halloween.

54
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,620
亲爱的 是你建议
Honey, you were the one who suggested

55
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:39,860
找一个巨大的南瓜
getting a giant pumpkin

56
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:41,180
然后让我们坐在里面划船
and having us sail away in it

57
00:01:41,180 --> 00:01:42,840
像是动画里的老鼠一家
like a family of cartoon mice.

58
00:01:43,480 --> 00:01:45,160
所有南瓜对老鼠来说都是巨大的
All pumpkins are giant to mice.

59
00:01:45,214 --> 00:01:48,400
我们俩争谁更迷恋一个
There is no use in us arguing over who's more obsessed

60
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,200
已经离我们远去的节日毫无意义
with a holiday that's behind us already.

61
00:01:50,220 --> 00:01:51,134
离我们可远了
Way behind us.

62
00:01:51,134 --> 00:01:52,660
好了 我得走了 亲爱的
All right. I got to get going, honey.

63
00:01:52,660 --> 00:01:53,820
对 今天过得开心哦
Yeah, have a good one.

64
00:01:54,729 --> 00:01:56,528
-很好 拜拜 -拜
- Great. Buh-bye. - Mm-hmm, bye.

65
00:02:00,879 --> 00:02:02,109
计划有变 各位
Change of plans, fellas.

66
00:02:02,160 --> 00:02:02,900
快上车
Hop in the car.

67
00:02:17,080 --> 00:02:18,160
哎哟哟
Well, well, well.

68
00:02:18,160 --> 00:02:18,840
你们城里人
You city folk

69
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,040
起得可真晚啊
sure are late risers.

70
00:02:20,120 --> 00:02:21,680
我猜你们的公鸡有个稍候再叫的按钮
I guess your rooster has a snooze button.

71
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:26,920
你每天都说一模一样的话好搞笑哦
It's funny how you say the exact, same thing every morning.

72
00:02:27,680 --> 00:02:29,819
由于我们的包工头暂停维修我们的厨房
Since our contractor took a break from rehabbing kitchens

73
00:02:29,819 --> 00:02:32,360
-改成"修"身养性去戒赌 -对
- to rehab a gambling problem... - Yeah.

74
00:02:32,360 --> 00:02:34,000
杰就接手了 我们就开始住在这儿
...Jay took over, and we've been staying here.

75
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:35,300
老爸花了不少时间精力
It's been a lot of Dad,

76
00:02:35,300 --> 00:02:37,100
但是... 继续住在家里
but it -- it just became too impractical

77
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:38,460
变得太不方便了
to continue living at home.

78
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,778
我们需要再涂一层亮光漆
We're gonna use another coat of varnish.

79
00:02:40,778 --> 00:02:43,120
味道应该不会太重
The fumes shouldn't be too noticeable.

80
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:45,300
-好 -天啊 莉莉
- Okay. - Okay. Oh, boy. Lily.

81
00:02:45,500 --> 00:02:47,180
天啊 她被熏倒了
Oh, gosh! Okay, she's down!

82
00:02:47,400 --> 00:02:49,480
我们住在没有厨房的地方很不容易
It's been hard on us, living without a kitchen.

83
00:02:49,480 --> 00:02:52,080
厨房烧了已经过了六周
It's been, uh, six weeks now since it burned down.

84
00:02:52,160 --> 00:02:52,960
从你把厨房烧了
Since you burned it down.

85
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,460
从我把厨房烧了
Since I burned it down.

86
00:02:54,520 --> 00:02:56,380
还蓄意让我以为是我干的
And then maliciously made me think I did it

87
00:02:56,380 --> 00:02:58,400
然后利用我的自责谋取你的私利
and leveraged my guilt for your own selfish gain.

88
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:59,900
还蓄意让你以为
Then maliciously made you think

89
00:02:59,900 --> 00:03:01,319
是你干的 然后利用...
that you did it, and leveraged --

90
00:03:01,319 --> 00:03:03,760
亲爱的 你不要再自责了
Honey, you got to stop beating yourself up.

91
00:03:03,760 --> 00:03:04,200
好吧
Okay.

92
00:03:04,600 --> 00:03:06,360
我要给乔做燕麦粥
I was going to make Joe's oatmeal.

93
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:09,160
你真的有必要把五个炉子都占着吗
Do you really have to use all five burners?

94
00:03:09,320 --> 00:03:10,300
这道菜就叫
Well, it is called

95
00:03:10,300 --> 00:03:11,500
五个炉子肉馅饼
Five Burner Meat Pie,

96
00:03:11,500 --> 00:03:14,322
是我们那里的万圣佳节传统菜肴
and it's the traditional dish back at the Halloween festival,

97
00:03:14,322 --> 00:03:16,426
让我感觉像在老家过节
so it kinda makes me feel like I'm there.

98
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,900
燕麦粥还没好吗
No oatmeal?

99
00:03:19,500 --> 00:03:21,620
我不等了 把胡子戴上吧
Guess I could put my beard on now.

100
00:03:21,700 --> 00:03:23,220
快来
Come over here!

101
00:03:24,160 --> 00:03:27,220
有点疼 对不起 但是我崇拜的上帝
Look, I'm sorry, but the God I worship

102
00:03:27,220 --> 00:03:30,420
是不会露出他自己的发根的 所以...
does not let his roots show, so...

103
00:03:30,420 --> 00:03:31,120
两周前
Two weeks ago,

104
00:03:31,120 --> 00:03:33,180
我们邀请米奇和小卡来这边住
we invited Mitch and Cam to stay here.

105
00:03:33,340 --> 00:03:34,540
是你邀请的
You invited them.

106
00:03:34,960 --> 00:03:36,480
对我们来说绝非易事
It's been hard on us,

107
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:38,560
但我们哥伦比亚人的传统
but it's part of our Colombian heritage...

108
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,440
是你的传统
Your heritage.

109
00:03:40,040 --> 00:03:41,400
就是欢迎家人
...to welcome family

110
00:03:41,400 --> 00:03:43,220
绝对不赶他们出去
and to never kick them out,

111
00:03:43,220 --> 00:03:46,020
即便有时候他们也许有一些越界行为
even when they might have some boundary issues.

112
00:03:46,500 --> 00:03:48,160
我回工地了
I'm heading back to the job site.

113
00:03:48,680 --> 00:03:50,019
我打算让伙计们休息一会儿
Gonna let the guys knock off

114
00:03:50,019 --> 00:03:52,920
请他们喝点儿小酒
for a little liqu-or-treating.

115
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,700
团队就应该这样...
Well, that is how you manage...

116
00:03:54,700 --> 00:03:56,580
才能把活拖到圣诞节才干完
...to stretch a job until Christmas.

117
00:03:56,720 --> 00:03:58,000
好了 你现在过去
Okay, you need to go over there,

118
00:03:58,180 --> 00:03:59,400
问问他还要修多久
find out how long this is gonna take.

119
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:01,080
我想把我的厨房要回来
I want my kitchen back.

120
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,672
好吧 老爸
Okay, uh, Dad?

121
00:04:02,672 --> 00:04:04,500
我们很感激你的辛勤工作
W-We appreciate all your hard work,

122
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:06,640
但是我们的进度好像有点落后了
but we're running a little past schedule.

123
00:04:06,740 --> 00:04:08,180
活总得干完才算完啊
The job is done when the job is done.

124
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:09,100
你们想要快的话
You want it faster,

125
00:04:09,180 --> 00:04:10,920
下次烧个书架好了
next time, burn down a bookshelf.

126
00:04:11,080 --> 00:04:12,920
很明显他根本就不会弄
Well, clearly, he doesn't know what he's doing

127
00:04:12,920 --> 00:04:14,395
而且骄傲得不肯承认
and he's too proud to admit it.

128
00:04:14,395 --> 00:04:14,780
我知道 我知道
I know. I know.

129
00:04:14,780 --> 00:04:18,280
我的早餐就是一根女人能量棒吗
My breakfast is a LUNA Bar for women.

130
00:04:18,780 --> 00:04:19,680
想点办法啊
Do something.

131
00:04:19,960 --> 00:04:22,080
他们是家人啊 你想要我怎么办
They're family. What do you want me to do?

132
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:23,420
你得开了你父亲
You need to fire your father.

133
00:04:23,480 --> 00:04:25,020
别担心 我会处理的
Don't worry. I'll take care of it.

134
00:04:25,140 --> 00:04:26,640
-米奇尔 -我对天发誓
- Mitchell. - I swear to God.

135
00:04:26,901 --> 00:04:29,360
答应我 你会把他们赶走
Promise me you'll get rid of them.

136
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:29,760
好
Okay.

137
00:04:30,140 --> 00:04:31,640
要让我相信你
Make me believe it.

138
00:04:31,880 --> 00:04:33,240
我对你发誓
I swear to you.

139
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:35,140
我不是跟男人约会
I didn't have a date with a guy,

140
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:37,120
而是跟德丝蒂尼[命运]约会了
but rather a date with Destiny.

141
00:04:37,400 --> 00:04:39,020
德丝蒂尼是我参加的视镜的
Destiny was the name of the casting director

142
00:04:39,020 --> 00:04:39,780
选角导演
I was auditioning for.

143
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:42,180
我看到一则招聘邮轮和声歌手广告
I saw an ad for backup singers on a cruise ship,

144
00:04:42,180 --> 00:04:43,300
我立刻知道是缘分来了
and I knew it was fate.

145
00:04:43,300 --> 00:04:45,800
我有天籁般的嗓音 又喜欢唱K
I have a killer voice, I love karaoke,

146
00:04:45,940 --> 00:04:47,880
更擅长在船上派对
and I'm great at partying on boats.

147
00:04:48,880 --> 00:04:49,260
海莉·邓菲
Haley Dunphy?

148
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:50,260
啊嘿[船员用词]
Ahoy!

149
00:04:50,920 --> 00:04:52,120
我会说"船语"哦
I speak "Ship."

150
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,860
一路顺风哦 船友们
Bon voyage, mateys.

151
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,060
技惊四座
I crushed it.

152
00:04:55,100 --> 00:04:56,720
连我的谦逊都是秒杀全场
I even crushed the modesty after.

153
00:04:57,300 --> 00:05:00,360
"不 谢谢你们给我这次演唱机会"
"No, thank you for the chance to sing."

154
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:03,820
贝丝和杰西卡
Beth and Jessica...

155
00:05:04,060 --> 00:05:05,240
-拜拜 -你俩留下
- Bye. - ...you guys stay.

156
00:05:05,340 --> 00:05:06,420
海莉 我们再联系吧
Haley, we'll be in touch.

157
00:05:07,740 --> 00:05:09,480
知道你俩是
I had a good feeling about you two

158
00:05:09,480 --> 00:05:11,340
卡帕姐妹会的之后 我就很看好你们
when I found out you were fellow Kappa sisters.

159
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:12,440
等下
Wait.

160
00:05:12,740 --> 00:05:14,400
你们是一个姐妹会的吗
You're all in the same sorority?

161
00:05:14,680 --> 00:05:16,240
是最棒的姐妹会
Only the best sorority.

162
00:05:16,940 --> 00:05:18,118
卡帕 卡帕 塞塔
Kappa Kappa Theta!

163
00:05:18,118 --> 00:05:19,980
-我想要... -行了行了
- Ooh, I wanna take ya - Okay, okay.

164
00:05:19,980 --> 00:05:21,920
这就是大家都讨厌大学生的原因
This is why everyone hates college graduates.

165
00:05:22,280 --> 00:05:23,700
我会走的
I will walk out that door,

166
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:25,700
但至少给我一点尊重
but at least show me enough respect to admit

167
00:05:25,700 --> 00:05:28,100
承认这个决定根本和才华无关
that this decision had nothing to do with talent.

168
00:05:28,120 --> 00:05:30,157
因为众所周知 我是最棒的
Because everyone knows that I was the best.

169
00:05:30,157 --> 00:05:31,920
挺有勇气
Well, that took a lot of guts.

170
00:05:32,620 --> 00:05:33,180
跟我来
Come with me.

171
00:05:33,340 --> 00:05:34,760
再来看一遍你的试唱吧
Let's take a second look at your audition.

172
00:05:35,140 --> 00:05:38,160
♪ 拥抱我 指责我 ♪
♪ To hold me, to scold me ♪

173
00:05:38,160 --> 00:05:42,160
♪ 因为我不乖时 我真的很不乖 ♪
'♪ Cause when I'm bad, I'm so, so bad ♪

174
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:43,400
看吧 我超棒的
See? I'm fantastic.

175
00:05:43,638 --> 00:05:44,641
接着看
Mm. Keep watching.

176
00:05:44,641 --> 00:05:48,042
♪ 让我们来跳最后一支舞 ♪
♪ So let's dance, the last dance ♪

177
00:05:48,373 --> 00:05:51,340
♪ 让我们来跳最后一支舞 ♪
♪ Let's dance, the last dance ♪

178
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,360
好了 我看够了
Okay. I've seen enough.

179
00:05:52,480 --> 00:05:53,280
不 不 不
Oh, no, no, no.

180
00:05:53,280 --> 00:05:54,840
我得忍着看完这一整段
I had to sit through this whole thing.

181
00:05:55,020 --> 00:05:55,660
你也别想跑
You will, too.

182
00:05:57,538 --> 00:06:00,040
你们要知道 这是60年代的
You got to remember, this was the '60s.

183
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:02,020
那时柜橱生意的竞争十分激烈
Competition in the closet game was fierce,

184
00:06:02,200 --> 00:06:04,380
人们都在追逐下一个大存储的点子
everybody chasing after the next big storage idea.

185
00:06:04,740 --> 00:06:07,318
历史学家称这段时期为空间战[太空竞赛]
Historians remember this period as the "Space race."

186
00:06:07,318 --> 00:06:09,162
-米奇尔 -爸
- Oh, Mitchell. - Uh, Dad?

187
00:06:09,334 --> 00:06:10,520
我想看下厨房
Uh, I would like to see the kitchen.

188
00:06:10,520 --> 00:06:12,760
我倒想喝啤酒能让我的头发再生
I'd like to think that drinking beer makes my hair grow back,

189
00:06:12,780 --> 00:06:13,637
但生活就是不公平的
but life ain't fair.

190
00:06:13,637 --> 00:06:15,560
好吧 我们得谈谈
Okay, uh, then w-we need to talk.

191
00:06:15,560 --> 00:06:16,600
你们先出去下
You guys want to take it outside?

192
00:06:16,700 --> 00:06:18,220
我得跟小赫哥谈一下
I need a couple minutes with El Rojo.

193
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,560
赫就是"红色"
Rojo means "Red."

194
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:22,360
好吧
Yeah.

195
00:06:22,360 --> 00:06:24,580
我组装东西很快 不像你的工人
I put things together quickly, unlike your workers,

196
00:06:24,580 --> 00:06:26,041
这也是我来这里的原因
which is, uh, why I'm here.

197
00:06:26,041 --> 00:06:27,461
爸 如果这活对你来说太难了...
Um, Dad, if this is too much for you --

198
00:06:27,461 --> 00:06:28,640
等一下
Now, wait a second.

199
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,880
你不会是来炒我鱿鱼的吧
You're not here to fire me, are you?

200
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:30,785
什么 不是啦
What? No.

201
00:06:30,785 --> 00:06:31,860
呵 那词太重了
Pfft! That's a strong word.

202
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:33,740
我这一生经历过太多炒鱿鱼
I've done enough axing in my time

203
00:06:33,740 --> 00:06:34,800
我知道你这个表情
to recognize the look.

204
00:06:35,080 --> 00:06:35,638
干脆点吧
Just do it.

205
00:06:35,638 --> 00:06:36,900
我 我本来更希望
See, now, I was -- I was hoping

206
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:38,280
这更像是一场对话
this would be more of a conversation.

207
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:40,080
你跟人对质的功力一直很差
Never been much for confrontation.

208
00:06:40,500 --> 00:06:43,080
你要是有本事打开天窗说亮话
You weren't engaged to a woman six months in law school

209
00:06:43,080 --> 00:06:44,580
也不会上法学院时 跟一个女的订婚半年了
because you were good at dropping the hammer.

210
00:06:44,780 --> 00:06:46,402
你们不是还一起养了猫吗
Didn't you guys get a cat together?

211
00:06:46,402 --> 00:06:47,604
好了 没错
Okay, you know? Y-Y-Yes!

212
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,160
你被炒了 行了吧
You're fired! Okay?

213
00:06:49,160 --> 00:06:50,720
你就是个没能力的戏精
You're an incompetent man-diva.

214
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,680
你唯一建过的一样东西
The only thing you've ever built

215
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:54,020
就是橱柜 也就是个装空气的盒子
is a closet -- I.E. a box of air.

216
00:06:54,140 --> 00:06:55,220
你走吧
So get out,

217
00:06:55,220 --> 00:06:56,420
小心你的大屁股
and don't let the door hit you

218
00:06:56,420 --> 00:06:57,520
别被门夹了
on your ample behind.

219
00:07:01,120 --> 00:07:01,860
不错
Nicely done.

220
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:04,080
不过对橱柜的攻击有些没必要
Maybe an unnecessary shot at closets,

221
00:07:04,080 --> 00:07:06,600
毕竟你没出"柜"整整22年
particularly from someone who was in one for 22 years,

222
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:07,840
但
but...

223
00:07:07,840 --> 00:07:08,680
我明白了
Yeah, I get it.

224
00:07:09,700 --> 00:07:10,920
我去拿我的东西
I'll just grab my stuff.

225
00:07:13,963 --> 00:07:16,460
天啊 爸 你弄完了
Oh, my God. Dad, it's -- it's done!

226
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:18,320
-对 -那你怎么不说呢
- Yep. - Well, why didn't you say something?

227
00:07:18,440 --> 00:07:19,820
我看到你怒气冲冲走进来
Well, I saw you marching in here,

228
00:07:19,820 --> 00:07:20,680
感觉要发飙
loaded for bear.

229
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:22,080
而你很少对别人发飙
You don't usually go off on people,

230
00:07:22,080 --> 00:07:23,160
我觉得让你发泄一下也好
so I thought it'd be good for you.

231
00:07:23,220 --> 00:07:24,760
-感觉如何 -我不喜欢那种感觉
- How'd it feel? - I didn't love it.

232
00:07:24,760 --> 00:07:25,920
但这个厨房真是太赞了
But this kitchen is amazing.

233
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:27,400
我还剩一件事要做
I only got one more thing to do.

234
00:07:27,400 --> 00:07:29,531
我得把玻璃装进门中 然后安装好门
I've got to seal glass in the door and hang it.

235
00:07:29,531 --> 00:07:30,817
你想要那个彩色玻璃
Now, you want to go with the stain

236
00:07:30,817 --> 00:07:32,777
还是小卡选的透明玻璃
or the clear pane Cam picked?

237
00:07:33,189 --> 00:07:35,440
你知道吗 我是在跳蚤市场上买的这个
Hmm. You know what? I-I bought this at a flea market.

238
00:07:35,440 --> 00:07:36,539
他们不知道是从哪来的
They're not sure of the origin.

239
00:07:36,539 --> 00:07:39,120
可能来自毁于地震的
It either came from a 17th-century Flemish cathedral

240
00:07:39,120 --> 00:07:40,338
17世纪弗兰芒教堂
that collapsed in an earthquake

241
00:07:40,338 --> 00:07:42,802
也可能是中学生演音乐剧《修女》时的道具
or a high-school production of "Nunsense."

242
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,079
我真心喜欢这个
Oh, I do love this.

243
00:07:44,079 --> 00:07:45,840
我是不是该问问小卡的意见
Should -- Should I ask Cam if it's okay?

244
00:07:45,840 --> 00:07:47,340
你差点炒了你爸
You almost just fired your dad.

245
00:07:47,380 --> 00:07:48,700
该不会在这事上犯怂吧
You're not gonna go shy on me on this --

246
00:07:48,700 --> 00:07:50,160
你说得对
You know what? You're right.

247
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:51,840
就要这个了
It's this glass.

248
00:07:52,020 --> 00:07:53,320
这就对了嘛
That's it. Hey?

249
00:07:54,040 --> 00:07:55,280
你想不想帮我完成这个
You want to help me finish this off,

250
00:07:55,340 --> 00:07:56,040
就咱俩
just the two of us?

251
00:07:56,180 --> 00:07:56,878
你知道吗
You know what?

252
00:07:56,878 --> 00:07:58,595
好的 我愿意
Yes. Yeah, I-I would.

253
00:07:59,032 --> 00:08:01,810
让我系上这个
Let me just strap on this bad boy.

254
00:08:05,025 --> 00:08:06,940
所有的工具都在地上摆好了
So, all the tools have been laid out.

255
00:08:06,940 --> 00:08:07,940
接下来呢
What next?

256
00:08:10,780 --> 00:08:12,720
-菲尔 -卡罗尔
- Phil. - Hey, Carol.

257
00:08:12,860 --> 00:08:15,040
我刚知道我家小孩把你院子弄成这样
I just found out my kids did this to your yard,

258
00:08:15,040 --> 00:08:16,740
实在很抱歉
and we are so sorry.

259
00:08:16,800 --> 00:08:18,240
不用啦 万圣节嘛
Don't be. It's Halloween.

260
00:08:18,300 --> 00:08:20,700
每年四大恶作剧日子之一
It's one of the four biggest prank days of the year.

261
00:08:20,880 --> 00:08:22,546
万圣节 愚人节
It's this, April Fools' Day,

262
00:08:22,546 --> 00:08:24,179
愚人节前一天
and the day before April Fools' Day,

263
00:08:24,179 --> 00:08:25,739
因为没人会有防备
'cause no one sees it coming.

264
00:08:25,760 --> 00:08:26,420
第四个呢
What's the fourth?

265
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:27,700
想得美 卡罗尔
Nice try, Carol.

266
00:08:28,080 --> 00:08:29,020
重点是
The point is,

267
00:08:29,020 --> 00:08:30,415
有一天你醒来
you're gonna wake up one morning

268
00:08:30,415 --> 00:08:33,180
发现你家小孩不再恶作剧了
and find out that your kids don't TP anymore.

269
00:08:33,180 --> 00:08:35,160
珍惜可爱的小坏蛋还作恶的日子吧
Cherish these days with your adorable little vandals.

270
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:37,040
感谢你的理解
Well, I appreciate the understanding,

271
00:08:37,040 --> 00:08:38,800
但我想给他们点教训
but I'm trying to teach them a lesson.

272
00:08:38,900 --> 00:08:39,919
我会给他们教训的
Oh, I'm gonna teach them a lesson,

273
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,200
因为报仇的时候到啦
'cause it's payback time.

274
00:08:41,448 --> 00:08:43,741
恶作剧大战正式开始
Pranks wars have begun.

275
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:44,280
太棒了
Yes!

276
00:08:45,580 --> 00:08:46,237
好了 孩子们
Okay, kids.

277
00:08:46,237 --> 00:08:48,040
我想邓菲先生还有更重要的事要做
I think Mr. Dunphy has better things to do

278
00:08:48,040 --> 00:08:49,720
才不会浪费时间和你们恶作剧大战
than spend his day in a prank war with you.

279
00:08:49,920 --> 00:08:51,920
好消息 孩子们 我没事
Good news, boys. I don't.

280
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:53,491
好吧
Okay.

281
00:08:53,491 --> 00:08:55,520
你完成不了作业
We cannot take you trick-or-treating

282
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:56,980
就不带你去讨糖
if you don't finish your homework.

283
00:08:58,257 --> 00:09:01,757
你俩不是有话要说嘛
Didn't you two have something you wanted to talk about?

284
00:09:02,671 --> 00:09:03,761
小卡
Um, so, Cam...

285
00:09:03,761 --> 00:09:05,143
我正在试着连无线网
I'm trying to get Wi-Fi

286
00:09:05,143 --> 00:09:07,500
这样才能看我老家的
so I can watch the pumpkin weigh-in

287
00:09:07,500 --> 00:09:08,800
万圣节南瓜称重赛
at the Halloween festival back home.

288
00:09:09,180 --> 00:09:10,080
25年前
You know, 25 years ago,

289
00:09:10,080 --> 00:09:11,720
我培育了威奇托最大的南瓜
I raised the largest Wichita Thumper,

290
00:09:11,740 --> 00:09:12,740
至今此记录还没被打破
and the record still stands.

291
00:09:12,800 --> 00:09:13,680
多多包涵
I am so sorry.

292
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:16,180
这话怎么说都听起来像小卡卖瓜
There's no way to say that that doesn't sound braggy.

293
00:09:16,380 --> 00:09:18,180
不不 你这么说还好啦
No, no, you just did fine.

294
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:20,940
但我想和你说
Um, but I just wanted to say to you --

295
00:09:20,940 --> 00:09:23,100
每个南瓜 都有一个故事
You know, as with every pumpkin, there's a story.

296
00:09:23,400 --> 00:09:25,377
那是一个寒冷的夜晚
It was a cold, bitter night,

297
00:09:25,377 --> 00:09:28,340
窗户传来咚咚咚敲打的声音
when tap-tap-tap on the window.

298
00:09:28,340 --> 00:09:30,560
惊奇的是居然是我南瓜的藤
Darn if it wasn't the vine of my pumpkin,

299
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:32,100
在外面摇晃
just out there trembling away.

300
00:09:32,340 --> 00:09:33,740
真是个好故事
That is a great story.

301
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,480
然后 我爸就把南瓜
Next thing I know, Daddy's pulling the pumpkin

302
00:09:35,480 --> 00:09:38,060
拉进了窗户 当然很小心 没弄断藤
through the window, careful, of course, not to break the vine.

303
00:09:38,100 --> 00:09:40,340
之后几个月 它成为我家的一员
And for months, it just became a part of our household --

304
00:09:40,440 --> 00:09:42,680
大家跨过它才能进厨房
people stepping over it to get into the kitchen,

305
00:09:42,840 --> 00:09:44,080
它挡住了半个电视
blocked half the TV.

306
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,040
我们以为《脱线家族》
We thought "The Brady Bunch"

307
00:09:45,040 --> 00:09:46,740
讲的是3个可爱女孩子的故事
was just about three lovely girls.

308
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:49,500
但没人抱怨
Oh, but nobody complained.

309
00:09:49,760 --> 00:09:51,280
当然 我获得了总冠军
Sure, I won Grand Champion,

310
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:53,540
还得到下一个龙卷风的命名权
you know, and the right to name the next tornado.

311
00:09:53,540 --> 00:09:55,840
但我印象最深的
But the thing I remember most

312
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:59,560
是我家人为我所做的牺牲
are the sacrifices my family made for just me.

313
00:09:59,840 --> 00:10:02,440
这就是我家乡对待家人的方式
That's how we do family where I'm from.

314
00:10:03,340 --> 00:10:05,881
我老家那也是这么对待家人的
That's how we do family where I am from!

315
00:10:05,881 --> 00:10:08,192
歌洛莉亚 我得赶紧连上网
Oh, Gloria! I got to get this Wi-Fi.

316
00:10:10,940 --> 00:10:12,760
你都看见了 是不是
You saw that, didn't you?

317
00:10:13,380 --> 00:10:14,940
人在做天在看
I see everything.

318
00:10:15,887 --> 00:10:18,680
你们十分钟后突袭办公室
In 10 minutes, you're gonna storm the office,

319
00:10:18,680 --> 00:10:19,560
在所有人慌乱的时候
everybody freaks out,

320
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:21,780
我神奇女侠现身 击败丧尸
I go Wonder Woman, fight off the zombies.

321
00:10:21,940 --> 00:10:22,680
-明白了 -好
- Got it. - Okay.

322
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:24,440
我的孩子们或许不感兴趣了
My kids may be over it,

323
00:10:24,540 --> 00:10:27,300
但办公室的大家喜欢万圣节克莱尔
but at the office, they love Halloween Claire.

324
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,818
这是在普里契特衣柜工作的好处之一
It's one of the perks of working at Pritchett's Closets.

325
00:10:29,818 --> 00:10:33,200
虽然接下来一年你都得帮忙付咖啡钱
Sure, you got to pitch in for coffee the rest of the year,

326
00:10:33,200 --> 00:10:36,540
但万圣节那天的大戏是免费的
but on October 31st, the show is free.

327
00:10:38,191 --> 00:10:40,820
-大家马上就来开会了 -很好
- Everyone's on their way here to a meeting. - Great.

328
00:10:40,820 --> 00:10:43,340
今年不搞角色扮演了吗
Oh, so, no costume this year?

329
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:45,160
应该不会
Apparently not.

330
00:10:45,191 --> 00:10:46,740
明智之举
Oh, good call.

331
00:10:46,740 --> 00:10:48,440
所有人都受不了
Everyone was so sick of it.

332
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,940
变装压力太大了
The pressure to dress up!

333
00:10:49,940 --> 00:10:51,400
他们求我来和你谈谈来着
You know, they begged me to talk to you,

334
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,200
但我说 "不 克莱尔会意识到
but I said, "No, Claire will realize

335
00:10:53,200 --> 00:10:54,778
大家有多不情愿的"
how miserable everybody is."

336
00:10:54,778 --> 00:10:57,120
-这么说谁都 -我想喝你的...
- So no-nobody -- - I vant to drink your --

337
00:10:57,120 --> 00:10:58,620
我们不用再搞角色扮演了
We don't have to do it anymore.

338
00:10:58,680 --> 00:10:59,940
谢天谢地
Oh, thank God!

339
00:11:00,200 --> 00:11:02,180
你知道我今早照镜子时哭了吗
You know, I cried in the mirror this morning?

340
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:04,200
大伙 大伙 都结束了
Guys, everybody. It's over.

341
00:11:04,316 --> 00:11:07,084
终于不用再搞这一套了 别担心
The whole thing's finally over. No worries.

342
00:11:07,860 --> 00:11:08,320
是啊
Yeah.

343
00:11:08,617 --> 00:11:09,930
我先失陪片刻
I'm just gonna need a quick second.

344
00:11:09,930 --> 00:11:11,254
不不不 别别别
No, no, no. Stop, stop, stop, stop.

345
00:11:11,254 --> 00:11:12,333
-抱歉 -快走
- Sorry. - Go.

346
00:11:13,420 --> 00:11:15,240
请各位
So, if you could just,

347
00:11:15,515 --> 00:11:17,142
注意看屏幕
uh, take your attention to the screen, please.

348
00:11:17,580 --> 00:11:20,780
市场调查表明...
And... for the market research --

349
00:11:21,020 --> 00:11:22,300
拜托 没人想来这一出
Please. Nobody wants this.

350
00:11:22,520 --> 00:11:24,900
她想给我们个惊喜
Oh, she's surprising us.

351
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,720
丧尸来袭了
It's a zombie attack.

352
00:11:26,960 --> 00:11:27,620
万岁
Yay.

353
00:11:28,026 --> 00:11:31,785
但神奇女侠来救我们了 太好了
Oh, but it's Wonder Woman to the rescue, yeah.

354
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:34,160
神奇女侠 救救我
Wonder Woman, help me.

355
00:11:34,400 --> 00:11:36,540
好吧 好戏结束了
Okay, fun's over.

356
00:11:36,700 --> 00:11:39,060
快点 都走吧
Come on. Everybody --

357
00:11:39,760 --> 00:11:40,740
好吧 好吧
Okay! All right!

358
00:11:40,740 --> 00:11:41,870
给你 拿走 拿走
Here! Take it! Take it!

359
00:11:41,870 --> 00:11:44,432
天啊 我太抱歉了
Ow, God! I am so sorry!

360
00:11:44,880 --> 00:11:45,620
你这么早就回来了
You're home early.

361
00:11:45,620 --> 00:11:47,980
我本来与俱乐部一个叫艾比的女生打得火热
I was into this awesome girl, Abby, from the club.

362
00:11:48,060 --> 00:11:50,580
我们本打算今晚进入下一个阶段
And tonight, we were gonna take things to the next level,

363
00:11:50,580 --> 00:11:52,260
也就是 你懂 性
which is, you know, sex.

364
00:11:52,440 --> 00:11:53,718
想个代号总是好的
Always classy to name it.

365
00:11:53,718 --> 00:11:55,860
但问题是她特别善妒
But the one problem is she's super jealous

366
00:11:55,860 --> 00:11:57,400
她貌似觉得我在和
and got this idea I was messing around

367
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:58,840
小卖部的卡拉胡搞
with Carla from the snack bar.

368
00:11:59,560 --> 00:12:00,360
我的确有
Which I was.

369
00:12:01,060 --> 00:12:02,760
所以我得在去见艾比前
So I had to break it off with Carla

370
00:12:02,760 --> 00:12:03,540
和卡拉分手
before seeing Abby.

371
00:12:03,840 --> 00:12:04,457
顺利吗
How'd it go?

372
00:12:04,457 --> 00:12:07,398
她用食品夹把我一顿抽
I got a major tong lashing.

373
00:12:08,460 --> 00:12:08,860
搞什么
What the heck?

374
00:12:09,913 --> 00:12:11,380
卡拉 冷静点 等一下
Carla, calm down! Wait -- Oh!

375
00:12:11,380 --> 00:12:12,540
等等 让我解释
Wait, wait, I can explain!

376
00:12:12,660 --> 00:12:13,940
让我解释 谁来救救我
I can explain! Somebody help!

377
00:12:13,940 --> 00:12:16,450
于是我遮住我的淤伤
So I covered up my bruises

378
00:12:16,450 --> 00:12:18,420
清理了所有和小卖部有关的证据
and checked for any snack-bar-related evidence

379
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:19,240
才去见艾比
before seeing Abby.

380
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:20,500
抱歉我迟到了
Sorry I'm late.

381
00:12:20,860 --> 00:12:23,100
我传你的照片时扭伤了脖子
I got whiplash passing a picture of you.

382
00:12:23,440 --> 00:12:25,500
事情进展得不能更顺利了
Things couldn't have been going any better...

383
00:12:26,140 --> 00:12:28,320
我爸肯定会讨厌死你
My dad is going to hate you.

384
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,800
然后变得更顺利了
...and then they got better.

385
00:12:32,240 --> 00:12:32,800
直到...
Until...

386
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:33,000
芥末
Mustard?

387
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:34,720
你分明讨厌芥末
You hate mustard.

388
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:36,820
你个王八蛋 你又去和卡拉胡搞了
You son of a bitch! You were with Carla!

389
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,840
我知道有完美金句
I knew there was one perfect thing

390
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,060
说出来就能挽救大局
I could say to save it.

391
00:12:40,100 --> 00:12:42,320
宝贝 她不过是小卖部零食
Baby, I just snack with her.

392
00:12:42,320 --> 00:12:43,560
你才是主菜
You're the main course.

393
00:12:45,240 --> 00:12:47,160
我真的只是引用别人的话
I did not come up with that thing.

394
00:12:48,800 --> 00:12:49,600
好了
All right.

395
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:51,340
看起来不错
Looks good.

396
00:12:51,660 --> 00:12:52,759
这是我帮忙装好的
You know, I helped build that.

397
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:54,665
我感觉像个真的建筑工人呢
I-I feel like a real construction guy.

398
00:12:54,665 --> 00:12:56,260
我有点希望此时能路过个女人
I kinda wish a woman would walk by

399
00:12:56,260 --> 00:12:57,460
好让我说点物化女性的话
so I could objectify her.

400
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,320
那最爽了
It's the best.

401
00:12:58,432 --> 00:13:00,400
我们刚刚完成了一项工程
Listen, we just finished the project.

402
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:02,180
来 和你老爹去逛一圈庆祝胜利
Now, come on. Take a victory lap with your old man.

403
00:13:02,680 --> 00:13:03,860
乐意奉陪
I'd love to.

404
00:13:04,200 --> 00:13:05,660
我倒要看看小卡
Hey, and I defy Cam to find

405
00:13:05,660 --> 00:13:06,660
能挑出这玻璃什么毛病来
anything wrong with that window.

406
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:08,480
它真的为你的厨房添色不少
It really gives your kitchen some flair.

407
00:13:11,200 --> 00:13:12,020
歌洛莉亚
Oh, hey, Gloria.

408
00:13:12,564 --> 00:13:14,318
我终于找到无线网信号最好的地方了
I finally found a great spot for the Wi-Fi

409
00:13:14,318 --> 00:13:16,400
正好赶上南瓜称重
just in time for the pumpkin weigh-in.

410
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:19,540
我泡澡时你居然坐在这
You sit here while I take a bath?!

411
00:13:19,620 --> 00:13:21,040
你忘了我是基吗
I'm gay? Hello?

412
00:13:21,220 --> 00:13:23,180
我对你这件华美的浴袍更感兴趣
I'm more fixated on that fabulous robe.

413
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:25,160
我下次泡澡时绝对要借来穿
I am so borrowing that for my next bath.

414
00:13:25,260 --> 00:13:26,880
你洗澡水还没放掉吧
You didn't drain the water yet, did you?

415
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:28,140
好吧 够了
Okay, that's it!

416
00:13:28,140 --> 00:13:29,760
我再也受不了你了
I can't handle you anymore!

417
00:13:29,940 --> 00:13:31,040
你占据我的厨房
You take over my kitchen!

418
00:13:31,040 --> 00:13:33,200
我一转身 你就蹬鼻子上脸
I turn around, and you're in my face!

419
00:13:33,580 --> 00:13:35,600
连体婴都比我有更多个人空间
Siamese twins have more privacy than me!

420
00:13:35,740 --> 00:13:38,040
从我家滚出去 再也别回来了
Get out of my house, and never come back!

421
00:13:41,440 --> 00:13:42,700
厨房装修好了
Well, the kitchen's done.

422
00:13:42,940 --> 00:13:45,100
看来我能搬回家去了
So I guess I can move back home.

423
00:13:46,940 --> 00:13:49,860
他就不能早一分钟发这条信息吗
He couldn't have sent you that message one minute ago?

424
00:13:50,360 --> 00:13:51,180
没关系的 歌洛莉亚
It's okay, Gloria.

425
00:13:51,220 --> 00:13:53,100
我知道你的真实想法比较好
It's better that I know how you actually feel.

426
00:13:55,460 --> 00:13:56,962
南瓜节的主席台上
Well, there seems to be a lot of hubbub

427
00:13:56,962 --> 00:13:59,064
似乎有不小的骚动
on the dais at pump' fest.

428
00:13:59,220 --> 00:14:01,000
他们为什么要聚集还在世的历任市长
Why are they gathering all the living mayors?

429
00:14:01,520 --> 00:14:02,308
正式宣布
It's official.

430
00:14:02,308 --> 00:14:06,265
达拉·宝华特女士打破了旧南瓜记录
Ms. Darla Bowater has shattered the old pumpkin record.

431
00:14:07,032 --> 00:14:08,004
好吧
Okay.

432
00:14:08,120 --> 00:14:09,840
我想你能理解 发生这些事
I'm sure you'll understand, under these circumstances,

433
00:14:10,020 --> 00:14:12,200
我会快速收拾东西 泡个澡
I'll just quickly gather my things, take that bath,

434
00:14:12,200 --> 00:14:14,880
然后... 走人
and... be on my way.

435
00:14:16,760 --> 00:14:17,780
是哪位
Who is it?

436
00:14:18,060 --> 00:14:20,340
联合快递特快邮件
Special delivery from UPS.

437
00:14:20,840 --> 00:14:22,740
联合恶作剧快递
United Prank Service.

438
00:14:23,040 --> 00:14:24,840
这个恶作剧我参考了历史书
I went to the history books for this one,

439
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:26,720
追溯到恶作剧鼻祖
all the way back to the first practical joke --

440
00:14:26,800 --> 00:14:27,498
特洛伊木马
the Trojan Horse.

441
00:14:27,498 --> 00:14:30,140
不过我用喷彩代替了大刀
Only I swapped out silly string for broad swords

442
00:14:30,140 --> 00:14:31,460
用欢笑代替了谋杀
and laughter for murder.

443
00:14:32,220 --> 00:14:32,640
好的
Okay.

444
00:14:34,375 --> 00:14:36,098
你们喜欢恶作剧是吧
You guys want to prank?

445
00:14:36,520 --> 00:14:37,040
那就来恶作剧
Let's prank.

446
00:14:39,300 --> 00:14:40,220
不
Oh, no.

447
00:14:41,840 --> 00:14:43,160
不
Oh, no!

448
00:14:44,940 --> 00:14:45,980
不
No!

449
00:14:46,246 --> 00:14:46,618
不
Nooooo!

450
00:14:47,080 --> 00:14:51,480
不 老天爷啊
No! God!

451
00:14:56,340 --> 00:15:00,100
他们不过是朝你院子里扔了点厕纸
They just put some toilet paper in your yard.

452
00:15:00,370 --> 00:15:02,740
他为什么要这么对我们 妈妈
Why would he do this to us, Mother?

453
00:15:02,740 --> 00:15:03,680
这是场意外
It was an accident!

454
00:15:04,140 --> 00:15:06,640
毛毛哪去了 我找不到毛毛了
Where's Fluffy?! I can't find Fluffy!

455
00:15:06,900 --> 00:15:08,680
别担心 我帮你找
Don't worry! I'll help you find her!

456
00:15:09,020 --> 00:15:09,900
我的眼睛
My eye!

457
00:15:10,400 --> 00:15:12,020
快进屋去 快进屋去
Go in the house! Go in the house!

458
00:15:14,079 --> 00:15:17,220
我为什么觉得这么有活力
Oh, why do I feel so energized?

459
00:15:17,220 --> 00:15:19,840
因为满足了建造这份原始男性本能
Because you honored your primal male instinct to build.

460
00:15:20,020 --> 00:15:21,940
-是啊 -曾经贫瘠的荒原
- Yeah. - Where once lay barren fields,

461
00:15:21,980 --> 00:15:23,160
因为像我们这样的男人
because of men like us,

462
00:15:23,160 --> 00:15:24,720
如今成了灯火辉煌的都市
now gleaming cities stand.

463
00:15:25,060 --> 00:15:26,840
都市又是什么 不过是...
And what is a city, but --

464
00:15:26,840 --> 00:15:28,320
装载人类文明的衣柜
A closet for civilization.

465
00:15:29,945 --> 00:15:32,316
这是我这辈子最为你骄傲的一刻
This is the proudest damn moment of my life.

466
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:37,200
那让我想起了痛苦的回忆
That brings back painful memories.

467
00:15:38,920 --> 00:15:41,400
好像拐到我们家那条街去了
Huh, seems to be turning down our street.

468
00:15:42,580 --> 00:15:43,700
谁能想到啊
Well, what do you know?

469
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:47,163
中间这块水晶像放大镜一样聚光了
This crystal in the middle acted like a magnifying glass.

470
00:15:47,163 --> 00:15:48,160
-普里契特先生 -嗯
- Mr. Pritchett... - Yeah.

471
00:15:48,160 --> 00:15:49,740
过去两个月内已经发生了两次
...this is the second time in two months.

472
00:15:50,180 --> 00:15:51,520
很开心你这么喜欢我们
We love that you're a fan,

473
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:52,880
但或许你买本消防员日历就好了
but maybe you should just buy a calendar.

474
00:15:53,740 --> 00:15:55,820
抱歉 米奇 我也很难过
I'm sorry, Mitch. I feel really bad.

475
00:15:56,020 --> 00:15:57,460
你觉得能不能由你来告诉小卡
Do you think maybe you could tell Cam?

476
00:15:57,460 --> 00:15:59,760
我已经不在这儿打工了
Oh, I don't work here anymore.

477
00:16:03,900 --> 00:16:05,500
菲尔 亲爱的
Phil? Honey?

478
00:16:07,400 --> 00:16:07,880
克莱尔
Claire.

479
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,320
没有瞒下去的道理了
There's no sense in hiding it.

480
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:12,280
我确实买了个巨型南瓜
I did buy a giant pumpkin.

481
00:16:12,500 --> 00:16:14,140
我猜到了
I puzzled that one out.

482
00:16:14,320 --> 00:16:14,820
你说得对
You're right.

483
00:16:15,144 --> 00:16:17,228
我就是个痴迷万圣节的大孩子
I'm a Halloween-obsessed child-man.

484
00:16:17,380 --> 00:16:18,500
你想好过一点吗
Do you want to feel better?

485
00:16:18,740 --> 00:16:20,440
我把丧尸带去公司了 好吗
I took zombies to work, okay?

486
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:22,380
这馊主意死得好惨
And it died so hard.

487
00:16:22,540 --> 00:16:24,620
真要命 被玛格丽特同情
Oh, my God, to be pitied by Margaret...

488
00:16:24,800 --> 00:16:25,840
我想孩子们是对的
I guess the kids are right.

489
00:16:25,840 --> 00:16:28,300
我们是时候有个成年人的样子了
It's time for us to start acting like adults.

490
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:31,140
我们可以办晚宴 看舞台剧 开个人退休帐户
We can have dinner parties, see plays, open IRAs.

491
00:16:31,259 --> 00:16:32,600
我们有个人退休账户的吧
We have IRAs, right?

492
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,620
当头棒喝啊 克莱尔
Rude awakening, Claire.

493
00:16:34,018 --> 00:16:36,180
你以为自己是有趣有爱的爸爸
You think you're the fun-loving dad,

494
00:16:36,180 --> 00:16:39,240
给人带来快乐 让童真不死
putting smiles on faces, keeping childhood alive.

495
00:16:39,980 --> 00:16:41,500
结果你只是一个坐在南瓜坦克里
Turns out you're just the weird guy

496
00:16:41,500 --> 00:16:43,660
冲下人家车道的怪叔叔
barreling down a driveway in a pumpkin-tank.

497
00:16:43,660 --> 00:16:47,480
菲尔 我命令你不许再说这种话
Phil, I command you to stop speaking like that.

498
00:16:47,680 --> 00:16:49,380
请你让我沉浸在悲伤中一会行吗
Please let me have my feelings for one second.

499
00:16:49,780 --> 00:16:51,400
不 快转过来 真的 画面很美
No, come on, turn around. Seriously. It's good.

500
00:16:52,600 --> 00:16:53,400
神奇女侠吗
Wonder Woman?

501
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:56,720
正是 而且我为你做了计划
Yes! And I have plans for you!

502
00:16:56,960 --> 00:16:58,820
谁管其他人怎么想啊
Who cares what anybody thinks?

503
00:16:59,280 --> 00:17:00,860
孩子们吃屎吧 公司的人都吃屎吧
Screw the kids. Screw everybody at work.

504
00:17:00,940 --> 00:17:03,460
万圣节等我们哪天想放弃了才放弃
We'll give up Halloween when we are good and ready.

505
00:17:03,940 --> 00:17:05,400
你们扮的是谁
Who are you guys supposed to be?

506
00:17:05,780 --> 00:17:07,300
你们爸妈也想成为的牛人
Who your parents wish they were.

507
00:17:09,500 --> 00:17:11,040
和本分手进行得并不顺利
Ending things with Ben did not go well.

508
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,160
他一直在帮忙我起头
He kept giving me openings,

509
00:17:12,160 --> 00:17:13,560
但我就是狠不下心说出口
and I just couldn't pull the trigger.

510
00:17:13,920 --> 00:17:15,600
我干嘛一直吃这块不新鲜的面包啊
Why do I keep eating this stale bread?

511
00:17:16,080 --> 00:17:16,820
你也会这样吗
Do you ever do that?

512
00:17:16,920 --> 00:17:18,059
明知有样东西不好
Like, you know something's bad,

513
00:17:18,059 --> 00:17:19,503
但你还是要个不停
but you just keep going in for more

514
00:17:19,503 --> 00:17:21,208
因为这是你面前唯一的选择
'cause it's the only thing in front of you?

515
00:17:22,371 --> 00:17:23,906
对了 有件事挺恶心的
Uh, hey, this is gonna sound really gross,

516
00:17:23,906 --> 00:17:25,360
我手上贴了张止血贴
but I have a Band-Aid on my hand,

517
00:17:25,360 --> 00:17:27,700
在手毛特别浓密的地方 我知道一定会很痛
it's on a super-hairy spot, and I know it's gonna sting.

518
00:17:27,860 --> 00:17:29,360
你能不能帮我撕下来 拜托啦
Would you take it off for me, please?

519
00:17:29,680 --> 00:17:31,420
撕快一点 如果我注定会痛
And do it fast. If I'm gonna be hurt,

520
00:17:31,420 --> 00:17:32,680
那长痛不如短痛
I just want to get it over with.

521
00:17:34,341 --> 00:17:35,513
我想分手
I want to break up.

522
00:17:37,020 --> 00:17:37,800
可以点菜了吗
Ready to order?

523
00:17:38,159 --> 00:17:40,108
你刚才有没有听见我说的话
Uh, did you not just hear what I said?

524
00:17:40,108 --> 00:17:43,064
-没有 什么 -我想分手
- No. What? - I want to break up.

525
00:17:44,420 --> 00:17:46,860
我想点玉米片 你呢
So, I'm thinking nachos. What about you?

526
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:50,300
-我的天 我在和你分手 -什么
- Oh, my God! I'm breaking up with you! - What?

527
00:17:50,920 --> 00:17:51,880
很抱歉
I'm so sorry.

528
00:17:51,960 --> 00:17:53,940
这段时间很开心 但现在都结束了
It's been really great, but now it's over.

529
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,740
求你不要一哭二闹
Please don't make a scene.

530
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,860
我很难过 但我理解
I mean, I'm sad, but I get it.

531
00:17:58,080 --> 00:18:00,160
我们正处于人生不同的阶段
We're in different phases of our lives,

532
00:18:00,160 --> 00:18:02,880
你现在住在离我一小时以外的地方
and you live an hour away from me now,

533
00:18:02,880 --> 00:18:04,280
我上周末也和我前女友
and I made out with my ex

534
00:18:04,280 --> 00:18:05,900
在衣橱大会上亲热了
last weekend at the closet convention,

535
00:18:05,960 --> 00:18:07,221
所以我又有多忠贞呢
so how committed am I?

536
00:18:07,221 --> 00:18:09,406
加上你和我妈咪之间的矛盾
Plus that tension between you and Muh-ma -- Oy.

537
00:18:09,580 --> 00:18:11,140
你背着我偷吃了
You cheated on me?!

538
00:18:11,240 --> 00:18:12,580
我们当时喝醉了 好吗
We were drunk, okay?

539
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:13,940
而且她很难过
And she was really upset

540
00:18:14,060 --> 00:18:16,060
因为她得把孩子送去大学
'cause she had to drop her daughter off at college.

541
00:18:16,940 --> 00:18:17,820
你个渣男
You suck!

542
00:18:17,820 --> 00:18:20,240
我竟然浪费了那么多时间
To think I wasted so much time

543
00:18:20,240 --> 00:18:23,020
在你这个爱哭粘人幼稚烂人身上
on such a weepy, clingy, Pez-eating snore!

544
00:18:23,020 --> 00:18:25,920
真不敢相信我曾乖乖坐在那儿扮芭比
I can't believe I sat there and pretended to be a doll

545
00:18:25,920 --> 00:18:27,580
让你梳我的头发
as you brushed my hair!

546
00:18:28,200 --> 00:18:31,400
你几乎是我交过最差劲的男朋友了
You are almost the worst boyfriend I have ever had!

547
00:18:31,900 --> 00:18:34,660
最尴尬的一天奖得主是艾丽克丝
Okay, Alex wins most embarrassing day.

548
00:18:36,600 --> 00:18:38,000
先别急着颁奖
Not so fast.

549
00:18:38,020 --> 00:18:39,460
瞧这俩傻子
Look at these two ding dongs.

550
00:18:40,168 --> 00:18:43,595
那是爸妈在一个巨型南瓜里吗
Is that Mom and Dad in a giant "punkin"?

551
00:18:44,080 --> 00:18:46,100
至少这次我们没被拉去
Well, at least we didn't get dragged into it this time.

552
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:47,300
谢天谢地
Thank God.

553
00:18:47,419 --> 00:18:50,406
对 因为我们另有计划
Yep. Because we got stuff goin' on.

554
00:18:54,825 --> 00:18:55,828
小卡
Cam...

555
00:18:57,000 --> 00:18:59,200
我刚刚其实可以
I'm sure that there were better ways

556
00:18:59,200 --> 00:19:01,340
表达得更好一些
for me to say what I said.

557
00:19:01,438 --> 00:19:03,592
你在打包我的面霜
You're packing my face creams.

558
00:19:03,700 --> 00:19:04,900
不用道歉
No need to apologize.

559
00:19:05,340 --> 00:19:06,400
我知道我踩过界了
I know I crossed boundaries.

560
00:19:06,960 --> 00:19:07,840
我从小的环境就这样
It's how I grew up.

561
00:19:08,280 --> 00:19:09,490
所有人之间都没有秘密
Nobody had secrets from anybody.

562
00:19:09,490 --> 00:19:11,500
高中派对时 "真心话大冒险"我们只玩大冒险
At high-school parties, we just played Dare.

563
00:19:11,500 --> 00:19:12,540
我懂这种感觉
I know the feeling.

564
00:19:12,580 --> 00:19:14,080
我也是在一个小镇上长大的
I grew up in a small town myself.

565
00:19:14,140 --> 00:19:15,900
我们还不得不带陌生人到镇上
We had to bring in a stranger

566
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:19,180
好让孩子们学会不能和谁说话
so that the children could learn who not to talk to.

567
00:19:19,540 --> 00:19:21,782
我必须说 你的家乡往事
You know, I have to say, sometimes your hometown stories

568
00:19:21,782 --> 00:19:22,720
有时听起来是编的
sound a little made-up.

569
00:19:22,720 --> 00:19:24,080
我很抱歉我说了那些恶毒话
I am sorry that I was mean,

570
00:19:24,080 --> 00:19:27,960
我也很抱歉你不再拥有最大的南瓜了
and I am sorry that you don't have the biggest pumpkin anymore.

571
00:19:28,040 --> 00:19:31,060
其实这已经和保持记录无关了
It's not even about having the record anymore.

572
00:19:31,060 --> 00:19:33,880
那记录是我让小镇生活留在心中的方式
I-It's just how I kept the small town alive in me.

573
00:19:33,880 --> 00:19:35,400
-或许很蠢吧 -才不是
- Probably dumb. - No.

574
00:19:35,720 --> 00:19:38,420
离开自己热爱的地方 是很艰难的事
It's hard when you have to leave a place you love.

575
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:41,640
每一年 那地方好像都在渐渐消失
Every year, it feels like more of it fades away.

576
00:19:41,820 --> 00:19:44,120
我会很难过 因为我知道
I get very sad because I know

577
00:19:44,120 --> 00:19:47,755
我的口音几乎完全消失了
that my accent is almost completely gone.

578
00:19:47,755 --> 00:19:49,640
总之 我该走了
Anyway, I-I should go.

579
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:51,260
等等 我有东西给你
Wait. I have something for you.

580
00:19:53,980 --> 00:19:55,080
一颗南瓜籽
A pumpkin seed?

581
00:19:56,608 --> 00:19:59,941
我想或许明年它也能打破记录
I think it can be next year's record-breaker.

582
00:19:59,941 --> 00:20:02,361
天啊 歌洛莉亚
Oh, my... Gloria...

583
00:20:03,380 --> 00:20:04,159
好了
Okay!

584
00:20:04,159 --> 00:20:06,500
-好啦 好啦 -天啊
- All right, all right! - Oh, my gosh!

585
00:20:06,500 --> 00:20:07,600
老天啊
Oh, my God!

586
00:20:07,680 --> 00:20:09,120
我们乘着蔬菜浮在水面上了
We're floating in a vegetable!

587
00:20:09,380 --> 00:20:11,240
乘着巨型蔬菜
In a giant vegetable!

588
00:20:11,800 --> 00:20:14,060
当家人年纪渐长 你有两个选择
As families get older, you have two options --

589
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,678
你可以强迫大家在一起
you can force everyone together,

590
00:20:15,678 --> 00:20:18,180
也可以接受传统会消失
or you can accept that traditions die

591
00:20:18,180 --> 00:20:19,540
人会往前迈进
and people move on.

592
00:20:19,960 --> 00:20:22,800
除非你刚好有个巨型南瓜
Unless you happen to have a giant pumpkin.

593
00:20:23,420 --> 00:20:25,660
你们来这儿干什么呢
Hey! What are you guys doing here?

594
00:20:25,920 --> 00:20:26,740
我们收到暗示了
We got the hint.

595
00:20:26,740 --> 00:20:28,618
我们也来玩 你们才会开心
It wasn't gonna be fun unless we were here, too,

596
00:20:28,618 --> 00:20:30,120
所以我们追踪了你们的手机
so we tracked your phones.

597
00:20:30,120 --> 00:20:31,160
小卡说
Cam says the record

598
00:20:31,160 --> 00:20:34,160
北美45米南瓜赛艇的记录是18秒
for the North American 50-yard pumpkin dash is 18 seconds.

599
00:20:34,160 --> 00:20:36,309
-我们应该能做到 -我们肯定能做到
- I think we can do it! - Oh, I know we can do it!

600
00:20:36,309 --> 00:20:37,207
-给我们计时 -开划
- Time us! - Let's do it!

601
00:20:37,207 --> 00:20:38,324
-好的 -好咧
- Okay! - Okay!

602
00:20:38,400 --> 00:20:40,840
你们能做到 打破18秒记录
You can do it! Beat that 18 seconds!

603
00:20:42,140 --> 00:20:42,260
你们快到了
You're so close!

604
00:20:45,010 --> 00:20:46,867
等等 划到那边去
Wait! There -- row it there!

605
00:20:46,867 --> 00:20:49,889
我们成功了吗 花了18秒吗
Okay. Did we do it? Was that 18 seconds?

606
00:20:49,889 --> 00:20:51,581
是5分钟
5 minutes.

607
00:20:51,695 --> 00:20:53,182
好接近呀
Still close!

608
00:20:55,460 --> 00:20:56,800
事情的始末是这样的
All right, here's what happened.

609
00:20:57,360 --> 00:20:59,620
就在你刚发完短信说厨房弄好后
Right after you sent the text saying the kitchen was done,

610
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:01,981
检查员忽然上门突击检查
the inspector popped in for a little surprise visit.

611
00:21:01,981 --> 00:21:03,660
现在厨房的装修不合规
Now, it's before violations.

612
00:21:03,660 --> 00:21:06,043
我们得迟几周才能完工
Which pushes us back for a couple of weeks now.

613
00:21:06,043 --> 00:21:08,020
说是我的错 我可以承受小卡的怒火
Blame me. I can take the heat from Cam.

614
00:21:08,020 --> 00:21:09,558
但你们得去克莱尔家住
You stay with Claire.

615
00:21:09,558 --> 00:21:12,264
-因为我承受不住歌洛莉亚的怒火 -好
- 'Cause I can't take the heat from Gloria. - Right.

616
00:21:13,280 --> 00:21:15,720
你一个字都别说 都交给我
Not a word. I do all the talking.

617
00:21:15,860 --> 00:21:17,020
因为你很不会说谎
Because you're a terrible liar.

618
00:21:17,800 --> 00:21:19,520
你来了 今天怎么样
Hey, there you are. Good day?

619
00:21:20,931 --> 00:21:22,660
你这是什么意思
What...what's that supposed to mean?

620
00:21:22,660 --> 00:21:23,700
你只有心虚的时候才会嗯哼
You only say that when you're guilty.

621
00:21:23,800 --> 00:21:24,900
你身上有烟的味道
You smell like smoke.

622
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,260
天啊 你又把厨房烧毁了吗
Oh my god. Did you burn the kitchen down again?

623
00:21:26,300 --> 00:21:27,680
就好像你根本不希望我帮你一样
It's like you don't want me to help you.
